&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Konrad is an AI-driven digital consultancy and product-innovation firm providing AI, strategy, design, and technology services to the world’s most ambitious businesses and brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We empower industry-leading brands to navigate change, strategize, and build extraordinary custom experiences. In a landscape defined by human and machine collaboration, we bridge the gap between complex AI and beautiful product design. From strategy to implementation, our 750+ global experts deliver intelligent solutions trusted by 500 million people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Associate Consultant, you&#39;ll work across our Management Consulting, Project Management, Design and Technology teams, supporting senior team members while you build your experience. You&#39;ll help clients solve business problems through smart, intuitive, human-centred experiences, including tapping into the potential of AI. You&#39;ll also use digital and AI tools in your own day-to-day work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Help create digital and AI-enabled solutions for clients across a range of industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Build your expertise as a thought leader in design, technology and AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Support the team in understanding client business challenges and goals, including where digital and AI can make a difference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Work with Design and Technology teams to create great user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Research clients through interviews on their business processes and competitive positioning, using digital and AI tools to help gather and synthesize findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Take part in design thinking and technology architecture workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Prepare presentations, documentation and proposal responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A passion for, and understanding of, excellent user experiences and technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Curiosity about AI and comfort using AI tools to support your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong writing and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A desire to stay current on digital and technology trends, especially AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Self-motivation and a collaborative approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Comfort presenting and public speaking (an asset)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Mentorship Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Comprehensive Health &amp;amp; Wellness Benefits Package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Retirement Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Parental Leave Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Flexible Working Hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Work from Home Flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Service Recognition Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Socials, Outings &amp;amp; Retreats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Culture of Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estimated compensation for this position is $70,000 to $78,000. This is an estimate and a compensation offer will vary based on applicant&#39;s education, experience, skills, abilities and alignment with market data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Konrad is committed to maintaining a diverse work environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants, regardless of race, colour, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status will receive consideration for employment. If you have any accessibility requirements or concerns regarding the hiring process or employment with us, please notify us so we can provide suitable accommodation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we sincerely appreciate all applications, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/p&gt;
